# The machinery is not history.
#
# The lock, and the pipeline folders that move material around before it becomes a
# page: keep the folders, ignore whatever lands inside them. A failed 18 MB PDF must
# not live in git for ever.
.wiki.lock
*.lock

raw/_inbox/*
raw/_working/*
raw/_done/*
raw/_failed/*
!raw/*/.gitkeep

# Nothing else here is ignored on purpose. The pages, the index, the log, WIKI.md
# and _mail-seen.md ARE the memory: they are exactly what this repo exists to carry.
